{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_126_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_126","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，葬陳靈公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_126_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_126","textTraditional":"二、楚子圍鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_126_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_126","textTraditional":"三、夏，六月，乙卯，晉荀林父帥師及楚子戰於邲，晉師敗績。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_126_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_126","textTraditional":"績，功也。功，事也。日其事，敗也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_126_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_126","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_126_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_126","textTraditional":"五、冬，十有二月，戊寅，楚子滅蕭。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_126_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_126","textTraditional":"六、晉人、宋人、衞人、曹人同盟於清丘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_126_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_126","textTraditional":"七、宋師伐陳，衞人救陳。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}